Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(customization): Material (Google Messages) chat
 style on top of Monet

Adds the "Stile Material (chat)" toggle: bubbles, chat background, input bar,
avatars and home list styled like Google Messages, with the palette derived
from the system accent/neutral tonal palettes (MDC Hct).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
